{"name":"D.Mon","description":"MEKA部隊の新リーダー・D.Monは、比類なきゲーム・センスで仲間たちを率いて、どんな戦況をも切り抜ける。","backgrounds":[{"url":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt7ebd74c6809c3fd3/6a73d8a4a736253d5fc8a644/960_Dmon.png","sizes":["min","xs","sm"]},{"url":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/bltd3c87960c2414bdd/6a73d89ef42b958b982fa771/1600_Dmon.png","sizes":["md","lg"]},{"url":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt2543b5c043d434ed/6a73d8971bb9c51a0d6bc682/2600_Dmon.png","sizes":["xl+"]}],"portrait":"https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/a46c60b8562fdbd0b8308396d0808f7606fba208bc67cccf3f82fe56d2c73b9d.png","role":"tank","subrole":"stalwart","location":"韓国、釜山（MEKA本部）","birthday":"4月21日","age":28,"hitpoints":{"shields":0,"armor":275,"health":425,"total":700},"abilities":[{"name":"プラズマ・セイバー ","description":"エネルギー系の高速近接攻撃","icon":"https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/5b8ae7f23071c20d472d55243ddebe666c361bab598c18e12161b8415ee058de.png","video":{"thumbnail":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt472e52d23c6d191a/6a73de64458124cbbae14a74/plasmasaber.png","link":{"mp4":"https://blz-contentstack-assets.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt9fb75ef73b9da025/6a73e7e1458124d58ae14a7c/01_260727_DMon_WebAbilities_1P_PlasmaSaber_KG_0001.mp4","webm":"https://blz-contentstack-assets.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/bltafb4b78e2c2d80a0/6a73e7e85db6070a0dda4bd1/01_260727_DMon_WebAbilities_1P_PlasmaSaber_KG_0001.webm"}}},{"name":"携行型フュージョン・リピーター","description":"重機関銃を発射する","icon":"https://d15f34w2p8l1cc.cloudfront.net/overwatch/bedcca9c4d45135065757cd2f5ff48137b9694159ea5929959efa63e9a45dac7.png","video":{"thumbnail":"https://blz-contentstack-images.akamaized.net/v3/assets/blt2477dcaf4ebd440c/blt27451ee96e3e81a3/6a73de7d71372ae9b52ebc39/portablefusionrepeater.png","link":{"mp4":"https://blz-contentstac